OL,4,Afor first time at British Museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoors at the museum opened at 10:00
OL,7,FBST, with shield-wielding re-enactors
OL,8,Fin costumes from the era waiting
OL,9,Foutside.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
